{
  "style": "Premium minimalist puzzle aesthetic: crisp orthographic boards floating over soft gradient backdrops, with rounded 16–24px radii on tiles and gates. Materials feel tactile—velvety matte tiles and luscious semi-gloss paint that pools in micro-beveled grooves, catching a gentle top-front key light and a cool rim. Shadows are soft, 12–24px feather with subtle ambient occlusion at tile gaps; edges are clean and anti-aliased. Paint renders as a viscous ribbon with slight subsurface bloom, a thin darker edge, and faint ripple where the brush turns. Gates and switches use bold geometric iconography and embossed patterns for colorblind clarity. Overall mood is calm, cozy, and modern—pastel-forward but high-contrast, with tiny sparkles and dust motes used sparingly on unlocks; no harsh outlines, just confident shapes, soft speculars, and elegant UI micro-shadows.",
